lothlorien.message.lore.shunned=§7Aprende a viver em paz com a floresta e depois regressa.
## Context: Developer diagnostic shown to the player who runs /scriptevent lothlorien:renown. Translate labels; keep technical tokens and the command.
lothlorien.message.lore.debug.state=[lothlorien] renome %s (%s), capítulo %s, lições ativas: %s, tarefa: %s, harmonia %s
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "harmony". Lesson 1 (chapter I, a deed lesson): Harmony, the standing with the forest from Hated to Friend. Peaceful time inside the forest raises it; harming the forest's creatures lowers it; the leaf icon on the action bar shows the band; Friend is exactly +10 and any wrong deed loses it. The task: reach Harmony +3 or more and press 'It is done'.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.harmony.name=A harmonia da floresta
## Context: Lesson 1 (chapter I, a deed lesson): Harmony, the standing with the forest from Hated to Friend. Peaceful time inside the forest raises it; harming the forest's creatures lowers it; the leaf icon on the action bar shows the band; Friend is exactly +10 and any wrong deed loses it. The task: reach Harmony +3 or more and press 'It is done'.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.harmony.text=A floresta pesa a forma como nela caminhas. O tempo em paz entre as árvores cura a tua harmonia, enquanto ferir as suas criaturas a fere; o ícone de folha mostra onde estás. Com +10 tens a Amizade de Lothlórien, e qualquer ato mau a perde de novo. Caminha em paz até a tua harmonia ser pelo menos +3 e diz-me que está feito.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "elves". Lesson 2 (chapter I, lore): the elves are few. No new elves are born; only the border wardens return over time; healers keep the others alive; killing an elf costs dearly in Harmony.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.elves.name=O nosso povo
## Context: Lesson 2 (chapter I, lore): the elves are few. No new elves are born; only the border wardens return over time; healers keep the others alive; killing an elf costs dearly in Harmony.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.elves.text=O nosso povo é pouco, e não nascem novos elfos. Só os guardas da fronteira regressam, e os curandeiros mantêm vivos os restantes. Levanta a mão contra um de nós e o preço será alto.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "renown". Lesson 3 (chapter I, lore): Renown is what the player does for the elves (separate from Harmony); ranks Stranger, Welcome, Trusted, Elf-friend; it grows with deeds and tasks, is never lost, is known in every village, and opens deeper stock with the elven traders.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.renown.name=Renome
## Context: Lesson 3 (chapter I, lore): Renown is what the player does for the elves (separate from Harmony); ranks Stranger, Welcome, Trusted, Elf-friend; it grows with deeds and tasks, is never lost, is known in every village, and opens deeper stock with the elven traders.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.renown.text=O renome é o que fazes pelos elfos, e não é a harmonia. Cresce com cada feito e cada tarefa para os meus, e nunca se perde. Os seus postos são Forasteiro, Bem-vindo, De confiança e Amigo dos elfos, e a notícia viaja até cada aldeia. Quanto mais alto estiveres, mais fundo será o stock que os elfos te oferecerão.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "dew". Lesson 4 (chapter I, deed): morning dew. At dawn dew gathers on leaf litter and blossoms lying under Mallorn leaves; using a glass bottle on a dewy patch gives one drop and the patch dries; eight drops fill the bottle. Deed: fill a Bottle of morning dew.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.dew.name=O orvalho da manhã
## Context: Lesson 4 (chapter I, deed): morning dew. At dawn dew gathers on leaf litter and blossoms lying under Mallorn leaves; using a glass bottle on a dewy patch gives one drop and the patch dries; eight drops fill the bottle. Deed: fill a Bottle of morning dew.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.dew.text=Ao primeiro raio de luz as folhas choram prata. De manhã o orvalho pousa na folhada e nas flores que jazem sob as folhas de mallorn. Usa uma garrafa de vidro em cada local com orvalho: cada um dá uma gota e oito enchem a garrafa. Enche uma garrafa de orvalho da manhã.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "nectar". Lesson 5 (chapter I, deed): nectar blooms hang beneath Mallorn leaves and fill in four stages; a glass bottle on a full bloom gives Mallorn nectar and empties the bloom. Deed: bottle Mallorn nectar.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.nectar.name=O néctar de mallorn
## Context: Lesson 5 (chapter I, deed): nectar blooms hang beneath Mallorn leaves and fill in four stages; a glass bottle on a full bloom gives Mallorn nectar and empties the bloom. Deed: bottle Mallorn nectar.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.nectar.text=As flores de néctar pendem sob as folhas de mallorn e enchem-se em quatro etapas. Usa uma garrafa de vidro numa flor cheia e a flor começa a encher-se de novo. Enche uma garrafa de néctar de mallorn.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "depth". Lesson 6 (chapter II, lore): the forest has three depths measured from the border: the edge (border within about 16 blocks), the inner wood (within about 40), and the heart (farther). Real effects: border wardens off the villages' wooden decks are fewer the deeper you go; the rarest creatures are met more often deeper in.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.depth.name=A profundidade da floresta
## Context: Lesson 6 (chapter II, lore): the forest has three depths measured from the border: the edge (border within about 16 blocks), the inner wood (within about 40), and the heart (farther). Real effects: border wardens off the villages' wooden decks are fewer the deeper you go; the rarest creatures are met more often deeper in.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.depth.text=A floresta tem três profundidades: a orla, junto à fronteira; a floresta interior, mais adentro; e o coração. Perto da orla os guardas da fronteira andam em número, mas mais adentro são menos, exceto nas plataformas de madeira das nossas aldeias. As criaturas mais raras da floresta encontram-se com mais frequência quanto mais fundo caminhas.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "lembas". Lesson 7 (chapter II, deed): Lembas. Plant Western Corn and gather its grain; three grains and a sugar make two doughs; bake the dough in a furnace or smoker to a cake; a cake plus a Mallorn leaf makes wrapped Lembas, which lifts the Hunger effect when eaten. Deed: eat wrapped Lembas.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.lembas.name=Lembas
## Context: Lesson 7 (chapter II, deed): Lembas. Plant Western Corn and gather its grain; three grains and a sugar make two doughs; bake the dough in a furnace or smoker to a cake; a cake plus a Mallorn leaf makes wrapped Lembas, which lifts the Hunger effect when eaten. Deed: eat wrapped Lembas.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.lembas.text=Planta cereal do Oeste e colhe o seu grão. Três grãos e um açúcar fazem massa; coze a massa e embrulha o bolo numa folha de mallorn. O lembas embrulhado alimenta bem e tira a Fome: a comida para um longo caminho. Come um lembas embrulhado.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "fireflies". Lesson 8 (chapter II, deed): fireflies appear at night (low light) above the grass of the forest; using a glass bottle on one catches it and gives a Bottle of Fireflies. Deed: catch a firefly in a bottle.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.fireflies.name=Os pirilampos
## Context: Lesson 8 (chapter II, deed): fireflies appear at night (low light) above the grass of the forest; using a glass bottle on one catches it and gives a Bottle of Fireflies. Deed: catch a firefly in a bottle.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.fireflies.text=Depois do anoitecer, os pirilampos flutuam sobre a erva da floresta. Usa uma garrafa de vidro com um e fica apanhado: uma pequena luz para levar ou para dar ao acendedor de lampiões. Apanha um pirilampo numa garrafa.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "rope". Lesson 9 (chapter II, deed): Elven rope is crafted from one Bottle of morning dew and a golden fern (the dew takes a whole dawn to gather). Used on the side of a block it hangs down; used on a piece it lengthens the rope up or down; it can be climbed. Deed: hang an elven rope.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.rope.name=A corda élfica
## Context: Lesson 9 (chapter II, deed): Elven rope is crafted from one Bottle of morning dew and a golden fern (the dew takes a whole dawn to gather). Used on the side of a block it hangs down; used on a piece it lengthens the rope up or down; it can be climbed. Deed: hang an elven rope.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.rope.text=A corda élfica faz-se com orvalho da manhã e um feto dourado, e numa cabe todo um amanhecer de recolha. Usa-a no lado de um bloco e ela pende para baixo; usa-a num troço e ela cresce para cima ou para baixo. Pode ser escalada. Pendura uma corda élfica.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "gifts". Lesson 10 (chapter III, deed): gifts of the forest. Deer love Western Corn and a deer fed with it trusts the player; a Friend of Lothlórien (Harmony +10) may offer a Mallorn acorn to a squirrel, which runs on an errand and brings back a gift. Deed: send a squirrel off with an acorn (needs Friend).
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.gifts.name=As dádivas da floresta
## Context: Lesson 10 (chapter III, deed): gifts of the forest. Deer love Western Corn and a deer fed with it trusts the player; a Friend of Lothlórien (Harmony +10) may offer a Mallorn acorn to a squirrel, which runs on an errand and brings back a gift. Deed: send a squirrel off with an acorn (needs Friend).
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.gifts.text=Os veados adoram o cereal do Oeste, e um veado alimentado confiará em ti. Um amigo de Lothlórien pode oferecer uma bolota de mallorn a um esquilo; ele sai a correr numa missão e traz uma dádiva. Envia um esquilo numa missão com uma bolota.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "white_animals". Lesson 11 (chapter III, lore): a hint only. Rare white animals (the white deer and the unicorn) walk the deepest wood; to a friend of the forest they may give a gift or allow a bond. Do not name the animals plainly. Reading it enables two optional +1 Renown deeds.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.white_animals.name=Os brancos
## Context: Lesson 11 (chapter III, lore): a hint only. Rare white animals (the white deer and the unicorn) walk the deepest wood; to a friend of the forest they may give a gift or allow a bond. Do not name the animals plainly. Reading it enables two optional +1 Renown deeds.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.white_animals.text=Raras criaturas brancas caminham pelo mais fundo da floresta. A um amigo da floresta podem dar, ou podem levar. Mantém alta a tua harmonia e tem paciência.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "trades". Lesson 12 (chapter III, lore): the finest goods of the elven traders go only to an Elf-friend who is also, at that moment, a Friend of Lothlórien (Harmony +10). Renown is never lost; Harmony can be.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.trades.name=Os melhores bens
## Context: Lesson 12 (chapter III, lore): the finest goods of the elven traders go only to an Elf-friend who is also, at that moment, a Friend of Lothlórien (Harmony +10). Renown is never lost; Harmony can be.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.trades.text=Os melhores bens dos meus vão apenas para um Amigo dos elfos que, nesse momento, seja também amigo de Lothlórien. O renome nunca se perde, mas a harmonia sim. Guarda ambos.
## Context: Request of the gardener: plant five Mallorn acorns (they become saplings) inside the forest and let them stand; the count is kept and checked on delivery.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_acorns.text=O jardineiro pede um favor: cinco bolotas de mallorn plantadas na terra sob os beirais da floresta. Planta-as dentro da floresta e deixa-as ficar de pé.
## Context: Request of the gardener: bring two Bottles of morning dew.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_dew.text=O jardineiro pede dois frascos de orvalho da manhã para despertar as árvores jovens.
## Context: Request of the gardener: bring sixteen bone meal.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_bonemeal.text=O jardineiro pede dezasseis farinhas de osso para alimentar as árvores jovens.
## Context: Request of the healer: bring four Athelas.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_athelas.text=O curandeiro pede quatro athelas, a folha-do-rei que cura os feridos.
## Context: Request of the healer: bring two Mallorn nectar.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_nectar.text=O curandeiro pede duas garrafas de néctar de mallorn para os doentes.
## Context: Request of the healer: bring two Elanor and two Niphredil (flowers).
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_flowers.text=O curandeiro pede dois elanor e dois niphredil, flores da floresta profunda.
## Context: Request of the woodwright: bring 32 birch or cherry logs in any mix.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_logs.text=O carpinteiro pede trinta e dois troncos de bétula ou cerejeira, em qualquer mistura.
## Context: Request of the woodwright: bring eight string and eight feathers.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_fletching.text=O carpinteiro pede oito fios e oito penas para emplumar flechas.
## Context: Request of the woodwright: bring six iron ingots.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_iron.text=O carpinteiro pede seis barras de ferro para ferramentas.
## Context: Request of the lamplighter: bring three Bottles of Fireflies.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_fireflies.text=O acendedor de lampiões pede três frascos de pirilampos para acender as lanternas.
## Context: Request of the lamplighter: bring sixteen coal or charcoal in any mix.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_coal.text=O acendedor de lampiões pede dezasseis carvões ou carvões vegetais, em qualquer mistura, para as lâmpadas.
## Context: Request of the lamplighter: bring sixteen glass.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_glass.text=O acendedor de lampiões pede dezasseis vidros para as lanternas.
## Context: Interaction prompt for speaking with the Loremaster elf (opens his dialog).
action.interact.lothlorien.speak=Falar
